[I] Settings daemon for the COSMIC desktop environment

[T] cosmic-settings-daemon is the settings daemon of System76's COSMIC
[T] desktop environment. It applies and watches system settings and handles
[T] e.g. media and brightness keys, audio, theme and location dependent
[T] settings in the background.

[U] https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-settings-daemon/

[A] System76 <info@system76.com>
